OL,3,A'An annoying buzz': The search for
OL,4,Astealthier drones
OL,5,
OL,6,FNature lover Ashley Schmidt no longer
OL,7,Fspends much time in her garden, in the
OL,8,FDallas suburb of North Garland.
OL,10,FShe's also given up on cycling to the
OL,11,Flocal parks where she previously
OL,12,Fenjoyed taking close-up photos of the
OL,13,Fbugs, lizards and toads.
OL,15,FIt's all because she can't stand the
OL,16,Fsound of the delivery drones that fly
OL,17,Foverhead, depositing her neighbours'
OL,18,Fonline orders.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
